            "g": 0.48627450980392156,
            "b": 0.058823529411764705,
            "a": 0.8
          },
          "text": "Add a scale to map the date to the X-position. When scale type is <auto>, NodeBox plot recognizes the date format and will set the scale type to \"time\". Inspect the scales in the Detail view. ",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontColor": {
            "r": 0.9333333333333333,
