            "r": 0.30196078431372547,
            "g": 0.48627450980392156,
            "b": 0.058823529411764705,
            "a": 0.8
          },
          "text": "NodeBox Plot knows a Y-scale maps to the y-property of the mark. But since an explicit domain was used, it does not know which data attribute to map. Apply the Y-scale to the hours attribute. ",
