          },
          "text": "Replace all marks with a rectangle mark. Keep the style to reuse the x- and y-properties that were set by applying the X-scale (implicitly) and Y-scale (explicitly). Set the height and width. ",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontColor": {
            "r": 0.9333333333333333,
