            "g": 0.48627450980392156,
            "b": 0.058823529411764705,
            "a": 0.8
          },
          "text": "A scale can also be applied directly to a property using a Vega value reference. For example: {\"scale\":\"yScale\",\"field\":\"hours\",\"band\":1} (https://vega.github.io/vega/docs/types/#Value)",
          "fontSize": 12,
